<body>
  <main id="app">
    <section id="menuScreen" class="screen menu-screen">
      <div class="menu-card">
        <p class="logo-kicker">OFFLINE · 4 PLAYER · BOARD GAME</p>
        <h1>Forest <span>Party</span></h1>
        <p>한 대의 태블릿에서 네 명이 함께 즐기는 숲속 파티 보드게임. 갈림길을 고르고 별과 코인을 모아 60번째 턴의 왕관을 차지하세요.</p>
        <div id="mainMenu" class="menu-actions">
          <button id="newGameBtn" class="primary">새 게임</button>
          <button id="continueBtn" class="gold">이어하기</button>
          <button id="howToBtn" class="ghost">게임 설명</button>
          <button id="importBtn" class="ghost">백업 가져오기</button>
        </div>
        <div id="setupPanel" class="hidden">
          <h2>플레이어 준비</h2>
          <div id="setupGrid" class="setup-grid"></div>
          <div class="menu-actions"><button id="startGameBtn" class="primary">순서를 섞고 시작</button><button id="cancelSetupBtn" class="ghost">취소</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="menu-note">별도 서버 없이 실행되며 턴 종료 때 자동 저장됩니다. 미니게임은 가로 화면 멀티터치에 맞춰져 있습니다.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gameScreen" class="screen game-screen hidden">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="brand">🌳 FOREST PARTY</div>
        <div class="turn-pill">글로벌 턴 <strong id="globalTurn">0</strong> / 60</div>
        <div class="turn-pill">차례 <strong id="turnOrderText">-</strong></div>
        <button id="saveBtn" class="small ghost">저장</button>
        <button id="settingsBtn" class="small ghost">설정</button>
        <button id="menuBtn" class="small ghost">메인</button>
      </header>
      <div class="game-layout">
        <div class="board-wrap"><canvas id="board" width="1000" height="650" aria-label="Forest Party 게임 보드"></canvas></div>
        <aside class="side-panel">
          <div id="playerList" class="player-list"></div>
          <section class="action-panel">
            <div id="currentBanner" class="current-banner">게임 준비 중</div>
            <div id="diceDisplay" class="dice-display"><span class="die">?</span><span class="die">?</span></div>
            <div class="action-row"><button id="rollBtn" class="primary">🎲 주사위 굴리기</button><button id="endTurnBtn" class="gold" disabled>턴 종료</button></div>
            <div class="inventory-title"><span>인벤토리 · 먼저 아이템을 선택하세요</span><span id="inventoryCount">0 / 6</span></div>
            <div id="inventory" class="inventory"></div>
            <div id="messageLog" class="message-log" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div class="side-tools"><button id="exportBtn" class="ghost">백업</button><button id="rulesBtn" class="ghost">규칙</button><button id="debugBtn" class="ghost">디버그</button></div>
          </section>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <dialog id="modal"><div class="dialog-inner"><h2 id="modalTitle"></h2><div id="modalBody" class="dialog-body"></div><div id="modalActions" class="dialog-actions"></div></div></dialog>
  <section id="miniScreen" class="mini-screen hidden" aria-label="4인 동시 미니게임">
    <header class="mini-head"><div class="mini-title"><strong id="miniTitle">미니게임</strong><span id="miniSubtitle"></span></div><div id="miniTimer" class="mini-timer">0.0</div></header>
    <div id="miniArena" class="mini-arena"></div>
  </section>
  <section id="debugPanel" class="debug-panel hidden"><h3>개발자 디버그</h3><div class="debug-grid"><button id="debugValidate" class="small">맵 검증</button><button id="debugCoins" class="small">현재 +100 코인</button><button id="debugItem" class="small">아이템 지급</button><button id="debugSkip" class="small">다음 주기 직전</button></div><pre id="debugText"></pre></section>
  <input id="importFile" class="hidden" type="file" accept="application/json">
  <script type="module" src="../../shared/game-shell.js"></script>
